   "source": [
    "data=data.dropna(subset=[\"num_orders\",\"week\"]).copy()\n",
    "data[\"week\"]=data.week.astype(int)\n",
    "data[\"week_squared\"]=data.week**2\n",
    "data[\"price_difference\"]=data.checkout_price-data.base_price\n",
    "data[\"price_ratio\"]=np.where(data.base_price.ne(0),data.checkout_price/data.base_price,np.nan)\n",
    "data[\"any_promotion\"]=((data.emailer_for_promotion.fillna(0)==1)|(data.homepage_featured.fillna(0)==1)).astype(int)\n",
    "print(\"Data siap:\",data.shape)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "384dd874",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Feature Selection dan pembagian kronologis"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c083189c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Kolom `id` tidak digunakan karena hanya identifier. `center_id` dan `meal_id` diperlakukan sebagai kategori. Data dibagi berdasarkan urutan minggu, bukan random split, agar pengujian menggunakan periode yang lebih baru daripada pelatihan."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "id": "b1a0e179",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Batas minggu: 117\n",
      "Train weeks: 1 - 116 (361348, 17)\n",
      "Test weeks: 117 - 145 (95200, 17)\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "TARGET=\"num_orders\"\n",
    "cat_features=[\"center_id\",\"meal_id\",\"city_code\",\"region_code\",\"center_type\",\"category\",\"cuisine\"]\n",
    "num_features=[\"week\",\"week_squared\",\"checkout_price\",\"base_price\",\"price_difference\",\"price_ratio\",\"emailer_for_promotion\",\"homepage_featured\",\"any_promotion\",\"op_area\"]\n",
    "features=cat_features+num_features\n",
    "weeks=np.sort(data.week.unique())\n",
    "split_week=weeks[max(1,int(len(weeks)*0.8))]\n",
    "train_df=data[data.week<split_week].copy(); test_df=data[data.week>=split_week].copy()\n",
    "X_train,y_train=train_df[features],train_df[TARGET]\n",
    "X_test,y_test=test_df[features],test_df[TARGET]\n",
    "print(\"Batas minggu:\",split_week)\n",
    "print(\"Train weeks:\",train_df.week.min(),\"-\",train_df.week.max(),X_train.shape)\n",
    "print(\"Test weeks:\",test_df.week.min(),\"-\",test_df.week.max(),X_test.shape)\n",
    "assert train_df.week.max()<test_df.week.min()"
   ]
  },
